# Scenario: hospital improvement team investigates 30-day heart-failure readmissions.
fishbone "Heart-failure readmission causes"

effect "30-day readmissions above target"

category people "People"
category process "Process"
category policy "Policy"
category place "Place"

people: "Discharge teaching inconsistent"
  - "Caregiver absent at teaching"
people: "Teach-back not used to confirm understanding"
people: "No heart-failure nurse at weekends"
people: "Home-health handoff left on voicemail"

process: "Follow-up not booked before discharge"
  - "Weekend scheduling gap"
process: "Daily weight plan not documented"
process: "No 48-hour post-discharge phone call"
process: "Risk score not used to target follow-up"
process: "Diuretic titration plan left to the clinic"

policy: "Medication reconciliation incomplete"
  - "Home medication list unverified"
policy: "Formulary swap not explained to the patient"
policy: "Observation status limits home-care benefit"
policy: "Palliative referral criteria unclear"

place: "Limited transport to clinic"
  - "Rural patients travel far"
place: "Food access limits the low-sodium diet"
place: "No home scale in the household"
place: "Unstable housing after discharge"
